<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 01:57:29 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>无视关闭标志跑上阶梯</title><link>https://some.pics/6b00fa7e7f5ba</link><description>&lt;p&gt;我看到小径关闭的标志，并不想冒犯，虽然我有时确实会这样，但那个标志朝向另一个方向。事后回想，我跑上这些台阶后，我觉得这是命中注定的，因为上面还有一个标志没有移动。🫣&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt='A wooden staircase rises up a wooded, leaf-covered hill, with a "Trail Closed" sign blocking the bottom.' height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/ericmwalk/6b00fa7e7f5ba.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://ericmwalk.some.pics"&gt;@ericmwalk&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 01:57:29 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>日落虽美却难见真阳</title><link>https://some.pics/6b00d22070dc0</link><description>&lt;p&gt;日落很美，可惜我永远看不到真正的太阳&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="the sky is a gradient of blue, purple, pink, orange, and yellow" height="1250" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/horror/6b00d22070dc0.jpg" width="1250"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://horror.some.pics"&gt;@horror&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 23:05:08 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>高空飞机与月亮同框</title><link>https://some.pics/6b00d1c279646</link><description>&lt;p&gt;今天又拍到一架在巡航高度的飞机和月亮，哈哈&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="the moon with a plane and its trails" height="1250" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/horror/6b00d1c279646.jpg" width="1250"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://horror.some.pics"&gt;@horror&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 23:03:34 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>用回忆选择魔法材料</title><link>https://some.pics/6b00d12e0e873</link><description>&lt;p&gt;你的记忆可以引导你选择咒语材料。如果向日葵让你想起一个快乐的夏天，你可能会选择它们的花瓣用于庆祝咒语。那段记忆让你的选择对你个人而言具有意义。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Square botanical watercolor-and-ink illustration of two golden sunflowers with brown seed heads, sage-green leaves, and loose yellow petals on a light cream background. Dark brown serif lettering sits above the flowers, with a small gold emblem watermark at bottom-right. Text: Your memories can guide your choice of spell materials. Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6b00d12e0e873.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 23:01:05 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>户外时光很惬意</title><link>https://some.pics/6b00d0f5ee737</link><description>&lt;p&gt;在外面待一会儿感觉还挺不错的&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="a plane flying with a reddish tree in the frame" height="1250" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/horror/6b00d0f5ee737.jpg" width="1250"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://horror.some.pics"&gt;@horror&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 23:00:08 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>招财进宝精油配方</title><link>https://some.pics/6b00c68ea30d3</link><description>&lt;p&gt;招财进宝精油配方
https://mizjeannie.com/formulary/oil-blend-for-money-and-prosperity&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Oil Blend for Money and Prosperity. Ingredients: 1 fl oz Sweet Almond Carrier Oil; 4 drops Patchouli Essential Oil; 4 drops Sweet Orange Essential Oil, illustrated with almond branches and nuts, flowering patchouli, and an orange branch with fruit and white blossoms." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6b00c68ea30d3.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 22:15:45 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>爱丁堡城堡内部</title><link>https://some.pics/6b00a4e75ba54</link><description>&lt;p&gt;在苏格兰爱丁堡城堡内&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Inside Edinburgh Castle in Scotland is an ornately carved wooden wall with a wheel and muskets attached to it and two swords flanking it." height="5638" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/von/6b00a4e75ba54.jpg" width="3170"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://von.some.pics"&gt;@von&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 19:52:12 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>苏格兰是个傻地方</title><link>https://some.pics/6b00a3d1b8b9a</link><description>&lt;p&gt;苏格兰……是个愚蠢的地方。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A picture taken at night of the  Scott Monument, for Scottish author Sir Walter Scott. The statue has a parking cone on top of the head of the statue, a tradition in Scotland for many years now. " height="5712" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/von/6b00a3d1b8b9a.jpg" width="3213"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://von.some.pics"&gt;@von&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 19:47:33 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>太阳低垂的寻常一天</title><link>https://some.pics/6b007cc8058b4</link><description>&lt;p&gt;普通的一天，太阳升不到比这更高的地方。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A row of treetops, some of which are frost-covered, against a blue sky dotted with a few small clouds. The sun is low behind the trees, even though it is midday. " height="3461" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6b007cc8058b4.jpg" width="2596"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 17:01:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>今日对应：橙、蓍草、罗勒精油</title><link>https://some.pics/6b0029983168b</link><description>&lt;p&gt;**今日对应 — 2026年11月20日，星期五**

